#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.marble.appdata.xml:14
msgid "Marble"
msgstr "Marble"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.marble.appdata.xml:15
msgid "Virtual Globe"
msgstr "Virtualni globus"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marble.appdata.xml:17
msgid "Marble is a virtual globe and world atlas — your swiss army knife for maps that you can use to learn more about the Earth and other planets."
msgstr "Marble je virtualni globus i svjetski atlas — vaš švicarski nožić za karte, uz koji možete naučiti više o Zemlji i drugim planetima."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marble.appdata.xml:18
msgid "Explore the neighborhood with Marble's rich set of city and street level maps. Search for addresses and places of interest. Marble takes care of querying various search backends and presents their results in a unified view. Calculate pedestrian, bike and motorcar routes with ease — online and offline, with an arbitrary number of via points."
msgstr "Istražite susjedstvo uz bogat izbor gradskih i uličnih karata u Marbleu. Potražite adrese i zanimljiva mjesta. Marble dohvaća podatke iz različitih tražilica i prikazuje njihove rezultate u jedinstvenom prikazu. Jednostavno izračunajte pješačke, biciklističke i automobilske rute — na mreži ili izvan nje, s proizvoljnim brojem međutočaka."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.marble.appdata.xml:19
msgid "Start exploring the world. View clouds and sun shadow, follow satellites and space stations and display their orbits, all updated in real-time. Travel back in time and learn about historic views of our planet using maps from past centuries. Earth is not enough? Marble also offers maps of the moon and other planets."
msgstr "Započnite istraživati svijet. Prikazujte oblake i sjenu Sunca, pratite satelite i svemirske postaje te njihove orbite, uz podatke ažurirane u stvarnom vremenu. Vratite se u prošlost i upoznajte povijesni prikaz našeg planeta pomoću karata iz prošlih stoljeća. Ako vam Zemlja nije dovoljna, Marble nudi i karte Mjeseca i drugih planeta."

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
#: org.kde.marble.appdata.xml:32
msgid "Earth globe in Marble"
msgstr "Zemaljski globus u Marbleu"
